      "payload": "tree 8265edabe8040aaca04d403ece706f3edd5b7a7d\nparent a449ab75201e36a6ea9ba0510631c4e2b92bd692\nauthor SaladDay <1203511142@qq.com> 1792596802 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792596802 +0800\n\nSkip the free-slot suspension while a Session waits for its sandbox (#811)\n\nA placement counts as active before its sandbox exists, so a node looked\nfull right after a Session was placed on it. The node lane then ran a\nfree-slot suspension and created the placed Session's sandbox only after it.",
